  <h2>The Multi-Hub Advantage</h2>
  <p>To maximize your ROI, Fitclo operates as a multi-location <strong>Supply Chain Partner</strong>, utilizing the unique strengths of different manufacturing hubs in China.</p>
  
  <h3>Guangzhou: The Heart of Design & R&D</h3>
  <p>Our GZ headquarters is where the high-complexity sewing and fabric R&D happen. This hub is ideal for private label brands requiring intricate patterns, premium technical fabrics, and rapid sampling.</p>
  
  <h3>Seamless Technology & Production Feasibility</h3>
  <p>For a seamless legging order, ask Fitclo's Guangzhou, China team to confirm the workable production route, material requirements, MOQ and logistics plan. A combined shipment or cost saving depends on the actual order.</p>

  <h3>Why This Hub Model Wins</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Versatility:</strong> Handle both complex OEM and high-volume stock in one partnership.</li>
    <li><strong>Cost Optimization:</strong> We shift production to the most cost-effective hub based on your order type.</li>
    <li><strong>Risk Mitigation:</strong> Geographic diversification ensures your production continues even during local disruptions.</li>
  </ul>
